"1431873528756103", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314659_1431873532089436_5038866022270829266_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uG0IPMDx1dMQ7kNvwFBfFq5&_nc_oc=Ado1-ETy8BJ2Cq6HNPz4vxM2e579SsAa6O9bxE6jCVBB3WZ2twGwAsUopFGUvJNP514&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFYHqFEeTrfPSGjXMB3woO_TW617dbHAxpud5MQEGC0GA&oe=6A974FA6"}, {"file_name": "SShing_Gorillas.png", "id": "2122786411980754", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307962_2122786415314087_4365680937777363066_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zi6t9yrb604Q7kNvwFYrGW9&_nc_oc=Adr6ApvvnZlCk2oRApCe8q5UKUqrmsBXyaZMmFmVbUMRXP9ZrOxQlr9Hq2SPyIrzJgw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGHZl0lX3xmewpn4he_c_5Yk2d010Qu5ZGserPE_bWrwg&oe=6A971D08"}, {"file_name": "Shiny_Gorillassss.png", "id": "1035017409306453", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311585_1035017412639786_8488208877022903899_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v6cPFsOGI8gQ7kNvwGpA5mk&_nc_oc=AdoUqqt843Ozsnr5nWbbrnBnkmnCYjglwXmOHdLuGpck76l45G5hhxyTHN6Todqh6FM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFX5xSGfz8AXwxeePQWEMIfnlV458T_ci00-mwCIETk0Q&oe=6A972E54"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Chimpanzee Taggers", "keywords": ["chimpanzee", "taggers", "tag"], "long_description": "CHIMPANZEE TAGGERS\n\nSwing, run, and scale your way to victory in Chimpanzee Taggers, the ultimate fast-paced physics-based multiplayer tag game! Created by 4ever, this game takes high-speed chase mechanics to the next level with incredibly smooth locomotion, customizable lobbies, and non-stop action.\n\n\ud83c\udf1f GAME FEATURES:\n\nCLASSIC LOCOMOTION: Master the iconic physics-based movement where your arms are your only tools to climb, jump, and escape other players.\n\nSHINY ROCKS & COSMETICS: Earn in-game currency as you play to unlock a massive catalog of epic cosmetics to customize your gorilla and show off your unique style.\n\nCUSTOM ROOMS & REGIONS: Instantly create and host private rooms using simple codes, broadcast your lobbies, and hang out with friends globally.\n\nFREQUENT UPDATES: Dive into fresh features, seasonal map rotations, and exciting new items designed to keep the chase thrilling.", "short_description": "CHIMPANZEE TAGGERS\n\nSwing, run, and scale your way to victory in Chimpanzee Taggers, the ultimate fast-paced physics-based multiplayer tag game! Created by 4ever, this game takes high-speed chase mechanics to the next level with incredibly smooth locomotion, customizable lobbies, and non-stop action.\n\n\ud83c\udf1f GAME FEATURES:\n\nCLASSIC LOCOMOTION: Master the iconic physics-based movement where your arms are your only tools to climb, jump, and escape other players."}]}, "developer_name": "Onion", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kXqwtGWBD9fWiW06yY0FcuBgGJd_TOTDV5AA-TJrFNY/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Onion", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1V8eTZp7zPJ1Sf_aAXQgh1DtI5fTk_KH0KaAY4bznG38/edit?usp=sharing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1252365271298652"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "node